	<developer id="dev.eden-emu">
		<name>Eden Contributors</name>
	</developer>
	<description>
		<p>Eden is an emulator for the Nintendo Switch and Switch 2 consoles, derived from Yuzu and Sudachi.</p>
		<p>Features:</p>
		<ul>
		    <li>Large list of compatible and working games.</li>
			<li>Online connectivity via rooms.</li>
		    <li>Game modding and cheat support.</li>
			<li>Applets like the Mii editor and the Nintendo Switch home screen.</li>
			<li>Tool-assisted speedrun configuration.</li>
		</ul>
	</description>
